nt enemy types require different tactics, weapons and damage types. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/extras/4cbe4bf4c8abd8ed45f7222dbf4329f8.avif?t=1785935494\" width=1200 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/extras/63e6a7389b368c6b076a00ba848386f9.poster.avif?t=1785935494\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/extras/63e6a7389b368c6b076a00ba848386f9.webm?t=1785935494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/extras/63e6a7389b368c6b076a00ba848386f9.mp4?t=1785935494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/extras/82440f4e0688a4da56d31ccabeed11cd.avif?t=1785935494\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person open-world dungeon crawler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style dark fantasy visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expedition-based gameplay loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless interconnected world with unlockable paths, shortcuts and secret areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing danger during longer expeditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Methodical melee combat and ranged combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple character classes, weapons, spells and enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource gathering, crafting and inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures and rare equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps and environmental hazards</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Sceadu Eard is a hardcore retro-style open-world dungeon crawler set in an eerie dark fantasy world. Craft gear at your base, gather resources, master methodical combat, unlock new paths and return safely from each expedition.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/7ed3cbf58f7fff73035f9019685ebd085e13cb11/header.jpg?t=1785935494", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/0ca77fa86d62ffef28d4251911a6dfed0fd2eb5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785935494", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4964690/0ca77fa86d62ffef28d4251911a6dfed0fd2eb5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785935494", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I7-8700K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "